description.2:
{Advanced Blizzard}

Causes a huge blizzard that damages and slows a wide range of enemies. The slow is permanent and cannot be dispelled.

Damage inflicted is 30 points more than basic Blizzard.

description.3:
{Expert Blizzard}

Causes a huge blizzard that damages and slows a wide range of enemies. The slow is permanent and cannot be dispelled.

Damage inflicted is 90 points more than basic Blizzard.
